  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project deals deals with protection of working people from health and productivity risks due to work place heat exposure and links to   climate change.The issue is highly important for preventive methods   as it has been overlooked in climate change impacts in low and middle income countries. The project will use innovative approaches to       prevention and test them in real workplace situations</narrative>
